00:04:47.651 --> 00:04:50.791
Yet precious metals sector rotation remains unconfirmed.

00:04:51.191 --> 00:04:55.811
Two factors, one live uncertainty, which is the medium grade, not high.

00:04:55.811 --> 00:04:59.511
Price action was supported by volume on the buyback announcement.

00:04:59.851 --> 00:05:05.231
On Entry Day, watch the 20-day average volume as confirmation, not as a second thesis.

00:05:06.329 --> 00:05:11.449
